      "text": "*munch*..."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start_time": 30.0,
      "end_time": 31.6,
      "text": "Mmmmm! ♪"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start_time": 31.8,
      "end_time": 33.4,
      "text": "It's so good!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start_time": 33.6,
      "end_time": 35.2,
      "text": "...Not bad, I guess."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start_time": 35.6,
      "end_time": 38.8,
      "text": "Nothing beats a crepe after beating up monsters!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start_time": 40.8,
      "end_time": 43.0,
      "text": "Mio, did you find any good equipment?"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start_time": 43.5,
      "end_time": 46.0,
      "text": "Well, I just couldn't seem to decide..."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start_time": 46.2,
      "end_time": 49.8,
      "text": "With so many options, it's hard to choose, huh?"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start_time": 50.0,
      "end_time": 52.1,
      "text": "Hey. What should we do for our next job?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start_time": 52.3,
      "end_time": 56.0,
      "text": "I hope we can find a promising request..."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start_time": 56.1,
      "end_time": 57.9,
      "text": "Oh, yeah! Forget that for a sec!"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start_time": 58.0,
      "end_time": 59.5,
      "text": "Look at this, you guys!"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start_time": 60.0,
      "end_time": 60.8,
      "text": "Ta-da!"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start_time": 61.4,
      "end_time": 63.8,
      "text": "An upcoming idol concert?"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start_time": 64.0,
      "end_time": 66.1,
      "text": "What exactly is an idol?"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start_time": 66.3,
      "end_time": 68.4,
      "text": "It looks like they sing and dance!"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start_time": 68.5,
      "end_time": 70.8,
      "text": "Hey, Shiburin, wanna check it out?"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start_time": 71.0,
      "end_time": 72.2,
      "text": "Idols, huh..."
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start_time": 72.9,
      "end_time": 75.0,
      "text": "Doesn't sound like my thing."
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start_time": 77.0,
      "end_time": 78.5,
      "text": "I mean, you know..."
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start_time": 80.9,
      "end_time": 82.4,
      "text": "We're adventurers."
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start_time": 84.3,
      "end_time": 87.0,
      "text": "Ah... Hold on a minute!"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start_time": 88.0,
      "end_time": 88.8,
      "text": "Rin...!"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start_time": 88.9,
      "end_time": 90.0,
      "text": "Shiburin!"
    }
